APPROACHES SPECIMEN (approaches_head.glb) is a composite: SPL Head & Neck skull and
neck vessels, SPL-PNL brain structures registered into that skull, and MNI-space
HCP-1065 tracts/cranial nerves and arteries mapped into the same frame. Dural sinuses, bone flaps,
corridors, incisions, entry points and trajectory angles are schematic.

SKULL BONES SPECIMEN (skull_bones.glb)
- BodyParts3D 4.0: "BodyParts3D, (c) The Database Center for Life Science licensed under CC
  Attribution 4.0 International" (https://dbarchive.biosciencedbc.jp/en/bodyparts3d/lic.html).
  Mitsuhashi N, et al. BodyParts3D: 3D structure database for anatomical concepts.
  Nucleic Acids Research 2009. https://lifesciencedb.jp/bp3d/
  Changes: 20 skull bones selected, recoloured and assembled; suture bands and craniometric
  keypoints computed from bone contacts (the MacCarty keyhole is placed by rule). Shared under
  CC BY-SA.

