TCIA cases: only lesion meshes and a brain surface (skull-stripped in-house; no
scalp or face) are redistributed. The SPL Head & Neck atlas includes a skull
surface from the public MANIX sample CT, with no skin or face surface. The
SPL-PNL brain atlas's skin surface has been removed.

